rom harlem  [Applause]  the part of the process of collaboration  is the most gratifying thing that i do  i like to bring  a project to a city and hire the city to  build the project  there's a lot of work that is gathered  from  narratives and stories within the  communities all of this is all folded  into  the largest sort of project  so that's why i do it  my consciousness being awakened has  allowed me to sort of  find purpose  [Music]  you
 

